Rename hostPort to host because executorIdToHost stores only the hostname (or IP), not the host:port combination. This improves code clarity and prevents potential misuse.
{code:scala}
// TaskSchedulerImpl.resourceOffers

executorIdToHost(o.executorId) = o.host
