This issue is caused by {{ValidateExternalType}} and occurs on creating {{Dataset}} from {{{}Array{}}}/{{{}Seq{}}}/{{{}Map{}}} with {{{}mutable.Set{}}}:
 * When constructing {{{}AgnosticEncoder{}}}, {{scala.collection.Set}} is converted into {{{}IterableEncoder{}}}.
