SimpleDownloadWritableChannel implementation of closeAndRead method is not closing the writable channel. (compared to EncryptedDownloadWritableChannel implementation which is)
{code:java}
@Override
public ManagedBuffer closeAndRead() throws IOException {
  return new FileSegmentManagedBuffer(transportConf, file, 0, file.length());
} {code}
There is nothing explicitly closing the channel, and it's relying on finalizer/phantom cleanable to close the file descriptor.

